                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Safety stock = z × std dev of daily demand × √(assumed lead time). z is the standard-normal quantile of the assumed service level: 1.2816 at 90 %, 1.6449 at 95 %, 2.3263 at 99 %.</run>
